            <ArticleTitle>Use of oral montelukast in the treatment of asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>148-55</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Montelukast, a new leukotriene modifier, has several benefits in the treatment of asthma in adults and children including improved relief of asthma symptoms, rapid onset, a safety profile comparable with placebo, and oral, once-daily dosing means excellent adherence.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
